think Bare sshd -T on NixOS does not load /etc/ssh/sshd_config, so it exits on missing hostkeys to stderr and stdout is empty. sudo sshd -T -f /etc/ssh/sshd_config is the dump. ssh -l root Permission denied already closed the door.
obs Guide 1 practical landing is the refused root knock. Config dump is the extra meter.
